# Build product of make-fixtures.mjs, never committed.
#
# 79 files, ~11.9 MB, of which 11 MB is the two limit-crossing fixtures. This
# repo went from 82 MB to 49 MB by getting file bytes out of the database;
# committing a 10 MB blob to prove a 10 MB limit would put them back one layer
# up. The generator is deterministic and MANIFEST.txt pins every byte, so the
# bytes are reproducible rather than archived.
